    "problems": "The study reports test accuracy without paired training error, so it does not quantify generalization gaps. It says hyperparameters were not fine-tuned. Some flattened table entries make precise row alignment uncertain.",
    "rows_left_out": "Not all reported results were extracted. Omitted table results include FCN segmentation metrics (Table 3), group-size comparisons (Table 8), and round-off error values (Table 9), since they measure segmentation accuracy or numerical communication error rather than the listed claim's generalization properties. Figure-only training curves and performance timing were also omitted.",
